      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEzra esakhuleka evuma izono, ekhala eziwisela phansi phambi kwendlu kaNkulunkulu, ixuku elikhulu labantu abesilisa labesifazana labantwana babuthana kuye, livela kuye wonke uIsrayeli, ngoba abantu bakhala kakhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UShekaniya indodana kaJehiyeli owamadodana kaElamu wakhuluma loEzra wathi: Sonile kuNkulunkulu wethu, sazithathela abafazi bezizweni ebantwini balelilizwe; kodwa lakhathesi kusekhona ithemba koIsrayeli phezu kwakho konke lokhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke asenze isivumelwano loNkulunkulu wethu ukuba silahle bonke lababafazi labantwana babo ngeseluleko senkosi yami langesalabo abawesabayo umlayo kaNkulunkulu wethu; kwenziwe njengokutsho komlayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vukake, kungumsebenzi wakho, lathi sizakukusekela. Woba lesibindi, uwenze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasevukake uEzra, wabafungisa abapristi abayizikhulu lamaLevi laye wonke uIsrayeli ukuba benze lokhu okutshiwoyo. Bafungake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEzra wasesuka phambi kwendlu kaNkulunkulu, waya endlini kaJehohanani indodana kaEliyashibi lapho ayalala khona; kadlanga kudla, kanathanga manzi, ngoba wayelilela ububi babathunjiweyo abasebebuyile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwamenyezelwa kulo lonke lakoJuda laseJerusalema kubo bonke abasebebuyile ekuthunjweni ukuba babuthane eJerusalema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lokuthi ongafikanga ngensuku ezintathu uzathathelwa impahla yakhe yonke, akhutshwe ebandleni labathunjiweyo abasebebuyile, ngesimiso sezinduna labadala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke abantu bakoJuda labakoBenjamini babuthana eJerusalema ngensuku ezintathu; kwathi mhla wosuku lwamatshumi amabili lwenyanga yesificamunwemunye abantu bonke bahlala egumeni elingaphambi kwendlu kaNkulunkulu beqhaqhazela ngenxa yalindaba langenxa yezulu elikhulu elalisina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEzra umpristi wasukuma wathi kibo: Lonile ngokuthatha abafazi bezizweni, landisa ukona kukaIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke vumani isono senu eNkosini uNkulunkulu wabokhokho benu, lenze intando yayo; zahlukaniseni labantu balelilizwe, lilahle abafazi bezizweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lonke ibandla laphendula ngelizwi elikhulu lathi: Kulungile, sizakwenza lokho okutshoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa abantu banengi, futhi lezulu liyana kakhulu, singeme egcekeni. Futhi lumsebenzi kawusiwo wosuku olulodwa kumbe owensuku ezimbili, ngoba sonile kakhulu ngalindaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izinduna zethu kazimele ibandla lonke, kuthi bonke abasemizini yethu abathatha abafazi bezizweni beze ngezikhathi ezimisiweyo yilowo lalowo elabadala labahluleli bomuzi wakibo, luze ludede ulaka olukhulu lukaNkulunkulu wethu mayelana lalindaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaba ngoJonathani indodana kaAsaheli loJahizeya indodana kaTikiva kuphela abaphikisana lalokho; oMeshulamu loShabethayi umLevi babasekela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abasebebuyile ekuthunjweni benza njaloke. UEzra umpristi wakhetha amadoda ayeyizinhloko zezindlu ukuba bamele izindlu, ebabiza ngamabizo. Ngosuku lokuqala lwenyanga yetshumi lawomadoda ayihlalela phansi lindaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngosuku lokuqala lwenyanga yokuqala basebebaqedile bonke abantu ababethethe abafazi bezizweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phakathi kwamadodana abapristi ayethethe abafazi bezizweni kwakungoMahaseya loEliyezeri loJaribi loGedaliya, emadodaneni kaJeshuwa indodana kaJozadaki labafowabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafunga ukulahla abafazi babo, bathatha inqama, banikela ngayo ukuba ibe ngumnikelo wesono sabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emadodaneni kaImeri kwakungoHanani loZebadiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emadodaneni kaHarimi kwakungoMahaseya loElija loShemaya loJehiyeli loUziya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emadodaneni kaPashuri kwakungoEliyowenayi loMahaseya loIshmayeli loNethaneli loJozabadi loElasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KumaLevi kwakungoJozabadi loShimeyi, loKelaya othiwa nguKelita, loPethahiya loJuda loEliyezeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubahlabeleli kwakunguEliyashibi; kubalindi bamasango kwakungoShaluma loTelema loUri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KwabakoIsrayeli emadodaneni kaParoshi kwakungoRamiya loIziya loMalikiya loMijamini loEleyazare loMalikiya loBenaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emadodaneni kaElamu kwakungoMathaniya loZekariya loJehiyeli loAbidi loJeremothi loElija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emadodaneni kaZathu kwakungoEliyowenayi loEliyashibi loMathaniya loJeremothi loZabadi loAziza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emadodaneni kaBebayi kwakungoJehohanani loHananiya loZabayi loAthilayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emadodaneni kaBani kwakungoMeshulamu loMaluki loAdaya loJashubi loSheyali loJeremothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emadodaneni kaPahathi‐Mowabi kwakungoAdina loKelali loBenaya loMahaseya loMathaniya loBezaleli loBinuwi loManase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
